 A subtle sub-bass pulse anchors the track without intruding, and a sparse, brushed drum pattern rests far back in the mix. The arrangement barely moves — it breathes and shifts slowly like clouds, building to a gentle swell of layered vocals and pads in the final section before fading to near-silence. The production is hushed and intimate, leaving generous space between every element.\n", "\n[Intro - Granular pad texture, vinyl crackle, guitar fades in]\n\n[Verse 1 - Whispered female vocal over sparse guitar]\nStill water holds the sky\nI keep forgetting how to rest\nEvery thought drifts out like smoke\nNothing here needs to be fixed\n\n[Interlude - Pads evolve, guitar continues, sub-bass enters softly]\n\n[Verse 2 - Vocal slightly warmer, longer phrases]\nThe window frames the afternoon\nA rectangle of yellow light\nI've been sitting in this chair\nLong enough to feel alright\n\n[Chorus - Layered vocal harmonies swell gently over full pads]\nLet it go quiet\nLet it go slow\nNothing is lost\nJust below\n\n[Instrumental Section - Guitar and pads breathe, no vocal]\n\n[Final Verse - Vocal returns, softest delivery]\nSomewhere between awake and sleep\nThe mind forgets to keep its score\nI don't need to understand\nWhat the silence is here for\n\n[Outro - Layers dissolve one by one, guitar last, fades to silence]", 0, "fixed", 72, 120, "4", "en", "E minor", true, 2, 0.85, 0.9, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 261, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 264, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "li